**Claim 1.**

A light guide clamping mechanism comprising:

a carrier structure configured to receive at least one light guide;

a first securing element arranged on the carrier structure and defining a first securing distance;

a second securing element arranged on the carrier structure and defining a second securing distance; and

an intermediate carrier having a first surface and a second surface opposite the first surface, the intermediate carrier being disposed between the first securing element and the second securing element such that the first surface faces the first securing element and the second surface faces the second securing element;

wherein the first securing element is configured to clamp the at least one light guide against the first surface of the intermediate carrier and the second securing element is configured to clamp the at least one light guide against the second surface of the intermediate carrier; and

wherein the first securing distance is different from the second securing distance.
